  "executive_briefing": "The technical boundary between Bitcoin and Ethereum is dissolving as trust-minimized cross-chain liquidity infrastructure matures. Decentralized liquidity networks like THORChain and Zeus Network are actively replacing legacy wrapped assets with direct, native BTC-to-ETH swaps. Concurrently, ongoing legislative delays surrounding the Clarity Act in the US Senate have reinforced developer reliance on deterministic smart contract languages like Clarity. This shift allows developers to construct verifiable logic directly tied to Bitcoin's security model, offering a distinct alternative to EVM-based execution environments.",
